LPL rocalculus description

  specification description

    part vars   of sort list[identifier]
                import sigSyntax
    part funs   of sort list[pair[identifier,int]]
                import sigSyntax
  end

  query    of sort term // bool // list[variable] // substitution // int // eqSystem // 
  result   of sort term // 
  import
	rocalculus[funs,vars]
  // start with () query
  // start with (one_step) query
  start with (reduce) query
end
